OL,3,GNEWSAWarning as serious crash closes
OL,4,Aroad near Airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FHolidaymakers and motorists have been
OL,7,Furged to allow extra time for their
OL,8,Fjourneys after a serious crash closed a
OL,9,Fkey A-road to Bristol Airport.
OL,11,FAvon and Somerset Police said emergency
OL,12,Fservices are at the scene of a serious
OL,13,Fcollision on the A38 Bristol Road in
OL,14,FBrent Knoll.
OL,16,FThe road between the Fox and Goose Pub
OL,17,Fand the B3140 roundabout is shut and is
OL,18,Fexpected to remain closed until at
OL,19,Fleast midday.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
